.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt SOWA-MONITOR 8
.Os Sowa
.Sh NAME
.Nm sowa-monitor
.Nd serve a read-only live system dashboard on a Unix socket
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl Fl socket Ar path
.Op Fl Fl static-root Ar directory
.Op Fl Fl user Ar user Fl Fl group Ar group
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
collects bounded telemetry from
.Pa /proc ,
.Pa /sys ,
the mounted filesystems and the Sowa package and service state.
It serves a dashboard and a versioned JSON snapshot on a Unix socket.
It does not listen on an IP address, execute commands, accept filesystem paths
from requests, or implement a state-changing HTTP method.
.Pp
The packaged service creates
.Pa /run/sowa-monitor/sowa-monitor.sock
mode 0660, changes its owner and group to
.Dq nobody ,
and permanently drops to that account before accepting a request.
Use nginx with authentication and TLS to publish it.
.Sh HTTP INTERFACE
.Bl -tag -width "/api/v1/summary"
.It Pa /
Dashboard.
.It Pa /api/v1/summary
Current system telemetry as JSON.
.It Pa /healthz
Process liveness as JSON.
.El
.Pp
Only GET and HEAD are accepted.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "/usr/share/doc/sowa-monitor/nginx.conf.example"
.It Pa /run/sowa-monitor/sowa-monitor.sock
Default listening socket.
.It Pa /usr/share/sowa-monitor
Dashboard assets.
.It Pa /usr/share/doc/sowa-monitor/nginx.conf.example
Authenticated TLS reverse-proxy example.
.It Pa /var/log/sowa-monitor.log
Service diagnostics.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nginx 8 ,
.Xr service 8 ,
.Xr chkconfig 8
